MPV Audio Panel is an independent configuration and script package for mpv.

The monochrome logo path in config/scripts/audio-panel.lua is adapted from
mpv-player/mpv, etc/mpv.svg:
https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv/blob/master/etc/mpv.svg
The upstream project distributes this artwork under GPL-2.0-or-later.

The mpv name and logo identify the upstream player. This package is not an
official mpv release and does not include the mpv executable.
